From 08329ae20967f3ae0e21389a330c72b298ff9416 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ruscher <rruscher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:46:14 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 67/73] apps: Adds wlm_settings, for the DockApps' preferences
 and color themes.

A DockApp reads its preferences from ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME}/wlmaker/<app>.plist,
as wlmaker stores them from the dock-app's menu, and watches the file
through inotify to apply changes right away. Missing or broken files give
the defaults.

Also holds the color themes the DockApps share: Green LCD (Window Maker's
classic look), Amber, Blue, NeXT grey, and High contrast; 'Default' keeps
each DockApp's own colors. And wlm_settings_spawn, to run the command
configured for a click.
